# Raw and processed datasets are user-provided / generated - don't commit
# them, EXCEPT postings_filtered.parquet: the deployed Django backend
# (backend/matching/services.py) loads this one directly at runtime, and
# production has no raw postings.csv (~517MB, not committed) to regenerate
# it from - see docs/PHASE3_FINDINGS.md and backend deployment prep notes.
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/postings_filtered.parquet

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Fine-tuned model weights/checkpoints - large binaries, regenerate via scripts/finetune_sbert.py
models/
